      "severity": "info",
      "code": "EML149",
      "message": "\"ProductImage\" looks like a line item of \"Product\" but declares no parent.",
      "line": 68,
      "hint": "If a list of every ProductImage away from its Product is not a screen anyone opens, declare `%%entity ProductImage parent: Product` — the dictionary then drops its dashboard card and gives it a tab inside the Product window, linked on product_id. If it is a thing in its own right, leave it: a reference is the opposite on all three questions (§3.5.1).",
      "autoFixable": false
    },
